OL,3,GNEWSAIsraeli Triathlon Association
OL,4,Aconsidering legal action over Derry
OL,5,Arace
OL,6,
OL,7,FTriathlon officials in Israel have said
OL,8,Fthey are considering legal action over
OL,9,Fthe withdrawal of four athletes from an
OL,10,Fevent due to take place in Londonderry
OL,11,Fon Saturday.
OL,13,FWorld Triathlon confirmed on Thursday
OL,14,Fthat it had been asked by the Israeli
OL,15,FTriathlon Association (ITA) to "remove
OL,16,Fall the Israeli athletes entered" from
OL,17,Fthe event and had done so "with
OL,18,Fimmediate effect".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
