OL,3,GNEWSAIsraeli Triathlon Association
OL,4,Aconsidering legal action over Derry
OL,5,Arace
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe North West Triathlon Club (NWTC),
OL,8,Fwhich is organising the event, had
OL,9,Fraised possible safety concerns about
OL,10,Fthe participation of the athletes.
OL,12,FOn Friday, the ITA said it is "deeply
OL,13,Fdisturbed by the circumstances" that
OL,14,Fled to the athletes not taking part.
